{"id":"n64744-6-8","stage":0,"title":"바로 · 正","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64744-6-8-1","ko":"유민이네 집이 이 근처였던 것 같은데.","zh":"我记得裕敏的家好像就在这一带吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이네","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；네：表示某人一家或所属群体，如 대리네（代理家）。","readings":[{"term":"유민이네","audio":"/audio/b9bd44ca5fe8fc37ea50.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민이네","audio":"/audio/b9bd44ca5fe8fc37ea50.mp3"}},{"text":"집이","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집이","audio":"/audio/0f403a24bdd427c70421.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"근처였던","meaning":"附近，近处","explanation":"근처：附近，近处；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"근처","audio":"/audio/e44b07ac25b977cc36e5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62061","senseId":"1","lemma":"근처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"근처였던","audio":"/audio/7f025d465739fd8a682a.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"su